msgid "Scene:Panel:CrossTexture"
msgstr "Select across materials"

msgid "Help:CrossTexture"
msgstr "When on, Ctrl+click and drag selection can add parts (UV islands) from other materials (textures) to the same edit. One edit per texture is created and linked, so colors and settings apply to all of them."

msgid "Scene:Panel:SelectHidden"
msgstr "Select hidden parts too"

msgid "Help:SelectHidden"
