msgid "Scene:Panel:TexTransToolNotice"
msgstr "This avatar uses TexTransTool. In the preview, TexTransTool effects are not shown on top of this recolor. After upload, TexTransTool effects are applied on top of it."

msgid "Scene:Panel:HairToolNotice"
msgstr "This part is handled by Chimera Hair Master. On upload its processing is applied on top of this recolor, so export from Chimera Hair Master first, then recolor."

msgid "Scene:Panel:HairToolOver"
msgstr "This recolor is applied on top of Chimera Hair Master's color matching."

msgid "Scene:Panel:HairToolMerged"
msgstr "Hair with mesh merging ON in Chimera Hair Master can't be recolored. Turn merging OFF, or export from Chimera Hair Master first."

